# Implementation Plan: BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3 Cross-Encoder Reranking Layer

Implement a production-grade, resilient Cross-Encoder Reranking layer for MediSense RAG pipeline using `BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3`. The architecture consists of a Java `RerankingClient` and `RerankingOrchestrator` interfacing over HTTP with a Python FastAPI microservice (`reranker-service`), featuring built-in retries, 3s timeout, circuit breaker, and automatic RRF fallback.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Architecture Overview**:
> - **Java Side (`com.medisense.rag.reranking`)**: `RerankingClient`, `RerankingOrchestrator`, `RerankerCircuitBreaker`, and DTOs (`RerankRequest`, `RerankResponse`, `RerankedChunk`).
> - **Python Side (`reranker-service/`)**: FastAPI app loading `BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3` via `FlagEmbedding` / `FlagReranker`, listening on port 8001.
> - **Docker & Compose**: Dockerfile in `reranker-service/Dockerfile` and addition of `reranker-service` in `docker-compose.yml`.

## Proposed Changes

