### Python Reranker Microservice

#### [NEW] [main.py](file:///e:/agent/reranker-service/main.py)
- FastAPI application loading `FlagReranker('BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3', use_fp16=True)`.
- `POST /rerank`: accepts query, list of passages (`chunk_id`, `text`), and `top_k`.
- Batch scores passages using `reranker.compute_score([[query, passage.text] for passage in request.passages])`.
- Returns top-k passages sorted descending by cross-encoder score.
- `GET /health`: health check endpoint.

