### Java Backend (`com.medisense.rag.reranking`)

#### [NEW] [RerankedChunk.java](file:///e:/agent/src/main/java/com/medisense/rag/reranking/model/RerankedChunk.java)
- Immutable Record representing reranked chunks: `(UUID chunkId, String sectionHeading, String content, double score, int rank, String source, boolean isReranked)`.

#### [NEW] [RerankRequest.java](file:///e:/agent/src/main/java/com/medisense/rag/reranking/model/RerankRequest.java)
- Request DTO matching Python endpoint schema: `(String query, List<PassageDto> passages, int topK)`.

#### [NEW] [RerankResponse.java](file:///e:/agent/src/main/java/com/medisense/rag/reranking/model/RerankResponse.java)
- Response DTO matching Python endpoint response: `(List<RerankResultDto> results)`.

#### [NEW] [RerankerCircuitBreaker.java](file:///e:/agent/src/main/java/com/medisense/rag/reranking/RerankerCircuitBreaker.java)
- Manages state (CLOSED, OPEN).
- Counts consecutive failures. After 3 failures, transitions state to OPEN for 60 seconds.
- Automatically resets state to CLOSED after half-open test / failure window expiration.

#### [NEW] [RerankingClient.java](file:///e:/agent/src/main/java/com/medisense/rag/reranking/RerankingClient.java)
- Spring `@Service` using `java.net.http.HttpClient` or `RestClient` with a 3-second connect/read timeout.
- Implements 2 retries with 500ms delay on failure.
- Integrates `RerankerCircuitBreaker`. If open or calls fail after retries, throws a controlled `RerankerUnavailableException`.

#### [MODIFY] [CrossEncoderReranker.java](file:///e:/agent/src/main/java/com/medisense/rag/reranking/CrossEncoderReranker.java)
- Replace stub with delegating calls to `RerankingOrchestrator`.

#### [NEW] [RerankingOrchestrator.java](file:///e:/agent/src/main/java/com/medisense/rag/reranking/RerankingOrchestrator.java)
- Receives query and `List<ScoredChunk>` (up to 20 items).
- Invokes `RerankingClient`.
- Maps returned cross-encoder scores back to `ScoredChunk` by `chunk_id`.
- On success: returns top-5 `RerankedChunk` objects with `isReranked = true`.
- On fallback (`RerankerUnavailableException` or error): logs warning, selects top-5 from input RRF `ScoredChunk` list, and returns them as `RerankedChunk` with `isReranked = false`.

